          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2608.22637",
          "summary": "OmniCAD is a benchmark of 25k mechanical assemblies with human-verified 3D models and 20-view renderings, evaluating component-level spatial reasoning, part-to-part relational reasoning, and tool-augmented agentic reasoning. Experiments show that current VLMs often produce inaccurate poses, invalid mating relationships, and part interpenetration, with performance degrading as assembly complexity increases.",
